{"title":"2001 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Evaluate <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/7/257bfdbbfbe8e50673f0ad06bc9f1389db815da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^5 - 2^3}{2^2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"61\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/8/7289c9417114c96eb373be16b14f6a3b70cd1369.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 1 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac{1}{4} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 0 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"401\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/e/f6e6ed1aa3e2205aaf1b723baf0182c35ed3adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^5 - 2^3}{2^2} = \\frac{32 - 8}{4} = \\frac{24}{4} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"266\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2001_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/b/2cb3bf5045569f9d87df0a6484fb7e99790ccd99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^5 - 2^3}{2^2} = 2^{5 - 2} - 2^{3 - 2} = 2^3 - 2^1 = 8 - 2 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(A) } 6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"399\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017153518\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 26/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 998/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:32884:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017153518 and revision id 253544. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}